---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="BulkMagic — Streamlining Multi-State Seller Onboarding" theme="light" includeCaseStudyScript>
<!-- Luminous Gallery Atmosphere: Layered Warm Ambient Gradients -->
<div class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-20 bg-[#FAF9F5]"></div>
<div class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-20 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_75%_55%_at_70%_10%,rgba(217,119,6,0.045),transparent_65%)]"></div>
<div class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-20 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_45%_at_15%_25%,rgba(13,148,136,0.035),transparent_60%)]"></div>
<div class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-20 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_55%_40%_at_85%_75%,rgba(217,119,6,0.03),transparent_70%)]"></div>

<main id="main" class="relative max-w-page mx-auto px-6 md:px-20 pb-72 pt-20 md:pt-32 font-sans text-neutral-800 selection:bg-amber-500/20 selection:text-neutral-900">

  <!-- CASE STUDY HEADER / FOLIO ARCHIVE DATELINE -->
  <header class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-6 mb-16 text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.36em] text-neutral-500 uppercase border-b border-neutral-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="text-neutral-950 hover:text-amber-700 transition-luxury font-medium">MEGHAN LENDHE</a>
      <span class="text-neutral-300">/</span>
      <span>CASE STUDY 02</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-neutral-500">
      <span>E-COMMERCE MARKETPLACE</span>
      <span class="text-neutral-300">/</span>
      <span class="text-neutral-700">SELLER ONBOARDING REDESIGN</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- HERO SECTION: Monumental Headline & Narrative Scale Bridge -->
  <section class="mb-32 md:mb-48">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mb-20">
      <span class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.36em] text-amber-700 uppercase block mb-6 font-medium">
        E-COMMERCE UX // SPRINT &amp; PILOT
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-[6.5rem] font-normal leading-[0.94] tracking-[-0.04em] text-neutral-950 mb-10 text-balance">
        Streamlining Multi-State Seller Onboarding.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-neutral-700 font-light leading-snug tracking-tight mb-14 max-w-[50ch]">
        Designing an adaptive compliance workflow and progressive onboarding flow to eliminate seller drop-off.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr] gap-12 lg:gap-24 items-start pt-6 border-t border-neutral-200">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-neutral-600 font-light leading-[1.75] max-w-[52ch] text-pretty mb-8">
            Online marketplaces face acute abandonment when onboarding independent merchants. Navigating multi-state tax permits, W-9 filings, and economic nexus thresholds introduces severe cognitive friction—<span class="text-neutral-950 font-normal underline decoration-neutral-300 underline-offset-8">turning seller acquisition into an operational bottleneck</span>.
          </p>
          <div class="font-serif italic text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed max-w-[46ch]">
            “When compliance requirements compound across 50 jurisdictions, simplicity is not the removal of rules—it is the intelligent orchestration of disclosure.”
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Margin Ledger: Project Specifications -->
        <div class="space-y-8 lg:pt-2 pl-0 lg:pl-10">
          <div class="text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.36em] text-neutral-500">PROJECT OVERVIEW</div>
          <dl class="space-y-6 text-xs font-mono">
            <div>
              <dt class="text-neutral-500 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-1">CORE CHALLENGE</dt>
              <dd class="text-neutral-950 text-base font-medium">50-State Compliance Friction</dd>
              <dd class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] font-sans mt-0.5">Nexus thresholds, tax permits &amp; W-9 intake</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-neutral-500 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-1">TIMELINE</dt>
              <dd class="text-neutral-950 text-base font-medium">3-Day Design Sprint</dd>
              <dd class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] font-sans mt-0.5">From compliance analysis to high-fidelity UI</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-neutral-500 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-1">MY ROLE</dt>
              <dd class="text-neutral-950 text-base font-medium">Lead Product Designer</dd>
              <dd class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] font-sans mt-0.5">Interaction design, user flows &amp; prototypes</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-neutral-500 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-1">COLLABORATION</dt>
              <dd class="text-neutral-950 text-base font-medium">PM, Engineering &amp; Head of Product</dd>
              <dd class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] font-sans mt-0.5">Campus pilot execution at University of Utah</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Image -->
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden pt-8 border-t border-neutral-200">
      <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-white/90 border border-neutral-200/90 shadow-xs">
        <img
          src="/assets/bulkmagic/cover.png"
          alt="BulkMagic seller onboarding interface overview"
          class="w-full h-full object-contain p-6 md:p-12 hover:scale-[1.01] transition-luxury duration-700"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-4 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-3">
        <span>Seller Onboarding Dashboard</span>
        <span>Multi-State Registration Overview</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 01: METRICS -->
  <section class="py-24 border-y border-neutral-200 mb-36 md:mb-52">
    <div class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.36em] text-neutral-500 uppercase mb-16">
      01 / Project Scope &amp; Timeline
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-16 md:gap-12">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="font-serif text-6xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-light text-neutral-950 tracking-tight">
          3<span class="text-amber-700 font-sans text-4xl sm:text-5xl"> Days</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-neutral-600 font-medium">DESIGN SPRINT</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-[32ch]">
          Rapid turnaround from regulatory mapping to production-ready design components.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="font-serif text-6xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-light text-neutral-950 tracking-tight">
          50<span class="text-amber-700 font-sans text-4xl sm:text-5xl"> States</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-neutral-600 font-medium">COMPLIANCE SCOPE</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-[32ch]">
          Dynamic nexus threshold validation and multi-state tax documentation checklists.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="font-serif text-6xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-light text-neutral-950 tracking-tight">
          5<span class="text-amber-700 font-sans text-4xl sm:text-5xl"> Steps</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-neutral-600 font-medium">FOCUSED STEPS</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-[32ch]">
          Context-aware module sequence replacing monolithic and repetitive application forms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 02: THE PROBLEM -->
  <section class="mb-48 md:mb-60">
    <div class="pb-5 mb-20 border-b border-neutral-200">
      <div class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.36em] text-neutral-500 uppercase">
        02 / The Compliance Problem
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-start">
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-6xl text-neutral-950 leading-[1.05] tracking-tight">
          Solving regulatory complexity before it creates abandonment.
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-neutral-600 font-light text-lg leading-[1.85] max-w-[54ch]">
          <p class="text-neutral-900 font-normal text-xl leading-relaxed">
            Marketplaces operating across multiple states must verify that sellers maintain valid tax permits, resale certificates, and business licenses according to local economic nexus laws.
          </p>
          <p class="text-neutral-500">
            For sellers, this meant confronting an ambiguous, monolithic intake form with unclear document requirements. For BulkMagic, incomplete or erroneous submissions required manual back-and-forth review, stalling marketplace supply growth and increasing legal exposure.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-600 pt-2 border-t border-neutral-200">
        <div class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.36em] text-neutral-500">KEY FRICTION POINTS</div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-amber-700 font-medium">01</span>
            <span>Unclear document requirements (W-9s vs. local state resale permits).</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-amber-700 font-medium">02</span>
            <span>Confusion around economic nexus rules and multi-state compliance.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-amber-700 font-medium">03</span>
            <span>Repetitive uploads without multi-file support or progress recovery.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 03: THE REDESIGNED EXPERIENCE -->
  <section class="mb-48 md:mb-60">
    <div class="pb-5 mb-20 border-b border-neutral-200">
      <div class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.36em] text-neutral-500 uppercase">
        03 / The Redesigned Onboarding Flow
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mb-24">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-6xl text-neutral-950 mb-6">
        Designing an adaptive, personalized onboarding flow.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-neutral-600 font-light leading-[1.7] max-w-[52ch]">
        The solution breaks the monolithic questionnaire into a 5-step adaptive journey that tailors document requirements to the merchant's business entity type and operating states.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-48">
      
      <!-- Feature 01: Progressive Disclosure -->
      <article class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr] gap-16 items-start group">
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-white/90 border border-neutral-200/90 shadow-xs">
            <img
              src="/assets/bulkmagic/progressive-disclosure.png"
              alt="Step-by-step business structure identification"
              class="w-full h-full object-contain p-6 group-hover:scale-[1.01] transition-luxury duration-700"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-4 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-3">
            <span>Step 1: Business Structure</span>
            <span>Adaptive questions based on entity type</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5 lg:pt-2">
          <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest block font-medium">STEP 01</span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-serif text-neutral-950 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition-colors">
            Progressive Disclosure
          </h3>
          <p class="text-base text-neutral-600 font-light leading-[1.75]">
            The onboarding begins by understanding the seller’s business structure and operating states. Only relevant subsequent fields appear, preventing merchants from being overwhelmed by inapplicable corporate compliance checks.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Feature 02: Dynamic Document Checklist -->
      <article class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] gap-16 items-start group">
        <div class="space-y-5 order-2 lg:order-1 lg:pt-2">
          <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest block font-medium">STEP 02</span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-serif text-neutral-950 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition-colors">
            Dynamic Document Checklists
          </h3>
          <p class="text-base text-neutral-600 font-light leading-[1.75]">
            A personalized requirements checklist updates in real time based on user inputs, explicitly detailing which certificates, permits, or EIN confirmations are required before submission.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-white/90 border border-neutral-200/90 shadow-xs">
            <img
              src="/assets/bulkmagic/document-checklist.png"
              alt="Dynamic requirements checklist based on seller profile"
              class="w-full h-full object-contain p-6 group-hover:scale-[1.01] transition-luxury duration-700"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-4 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-3">
            <span>Step 2: Dynamic Requirements</span>
            <span>Tailored document checklist</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Feature 03: Bulk Upload Hub -->
      <article class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr] gap-16 items-start group">
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-white/90 border border-neutral-200/90 shadow-xs">
            <img
              src="/assets/bulkmagic/bulk-upload.png"
              alt="Centralized batch file uploader for certificates & permits"
              class="w-full h-full object-contain p-6 group-hover:scale-[1.01] transition-luxury duration-700"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-4 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-3">
            <span>Step 3: Bulk Upload</span>
            <span>Batch uploading permits &amp; W-9s</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5 lg:pt-2">
          <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest block font-medium">STEP 03</span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-serif text-neutral-950 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition-colors">
            Bulk Upload Hub
          </h3>
          <p class="text-base text-neutral-600 font-light leading-[1.75]">
            Sellers can upload multiple tax forms, permits, and licenses in a single drag-and-drop batch. Intelligent file parsing maps documents to the appropriate requirement slots automatically.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Feature 04: Automated Real-Time Validation -->
      <article class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] gap-16 items-start group">
        <div class="space-y-5 order-2 lg:order-1 lg:pt-2">
          <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest block font-medium">STEP 04</span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-serif text-neutral-950 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition-colors">
            Automated Nexus Validation
          </h3>
          <p class="text-base text-neutral-600 font-light leading-[1.75]">
            Real-time validation checks evaluate merchant inputs against state-specific revenue thresholds, proactively identifying when economic nexus rules apply and preventing incomplete filings.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-white/90 border border-neutral-200/90 shadow-xs">
            <img
              src="/assets/bulkmagic/validation.png"
              alt="Instant error resolution & nexus compliance validation"
              class="w-full h-full object-contain p-6 group-hover:scale-[1.01] transition-luxury duration-700"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-4 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-3">
            <span>Step 4: Real-Time Validation</span>
            <span>Instant error checks &amp; nexus guidance</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Feature 05: Save & Resume Multi-Session Continuity -->
      <article class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr] gap-16 items-start group">
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-white/90 border border-neutral-200/90 shadow-xs">
            <img
              src="/assets/bulkmagic/save-resume.png"
              alt="Persistent progress saving with multi-session continuity"
              class="w-full h-full object-contain p-6 group-hover:scale-[1.01] transition-luxury duration-700"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-4 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-3">
            <span>Step 5: Save &amp; Resume</span>
            <span>Multi-session progress recovery</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5 lg:pt-2">
          <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest block font-medium">STEP 05</span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-serif text-neutral-950 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition-colors">
            Save &amp; Resume Progress
          </h3>
          <p class="text-base text-neutral-600 font-light leading-[1.75]">
            Recognizing that legal and tax filings often require consulting business partners or accountants, merchants can pause and resume anywhere, eliminating progress loss and reducing abandonment.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 04: BEYOND ONBOARDING · FROM AMBIGUITY TO CAMPUS PILOT -->
  <section class="mb-48 md:mb-60">
    <div class="pb-5 mb-20 border-b border-neutral-200">
      <div class="text-[9px] font-mono tracking-[0.36em] text-neutral-500 uppercase">
        04 / Beyond Onboarding: From Ambiguity to Campus Pilot
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mb-24">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-6xl text-neutral-950 mb-6">
        Taking a venture from ambiguity to a live campus pilot.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-neutral-600 font-light leading-[1.7] max-w-[52ch]">
        Before designing the onboarding compliance engine, I collaborated with BulkMagic's founders across multiple product pivots—shaping the product architecture from a PWA marketplace into a live group-buying campus pilot.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 mb-24">
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-white/90 border border-neutral-200/90 shadow-xs">
          <img
            src="/assets/experience/bulkmagic-app-marketplace.jpg"
            alt="Desktop and mobile exploration of a progressive web app marketplace"
            class="w-full h-full object-contain p-6 hover:scale-[1.01] transition-luxury duration-700"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-4 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-3">
          <span>Direction 01</span>
          <span>Progressive Web App Marketplace</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-white/90 border border-neutral-200/90 shadow-xs">
          <img
            src="/assets/experience/bulkmagic-group-buy.jpg"
            alt="Responsive BulkMagic group-buying product page concept"
            class="w-full h-full object-contain p-6 hover:scale-[1.01] transition-luxury duration-700"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-4 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-3">
          <span>Direction 02</span>
          <span>Group-Buying Pilot at U of Utah</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-16">
      <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 block">PIVOT 01</span>
        <div class="font-serif text-xl text-neutral-950 font-normal">PWA Marketplace</div>
        <p class="font-sans text-neutral-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Initial hypothesis exploring a discovery engine and app store for progressive web applications.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 block">PIVOT 02</span>
        <div class="font-serif text-xl text-neutral-950 font-normal">Group Buying</div>
        <p class="font-sans text-neutral-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Pivoted to a communal buying model leveraging volume tiers to unlock wholesale prices.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 block">PIVOT 03</span>
        <div class="font-serif text-xl text-neutral-950 font-normal">Campus Food Subscription</div>
        <p class="font-sans text-neutral-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Executed a live merchant pilot with UHungry Cafe at the University of Utah for subsidized student meals.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CHAPTER NAVIGATION -->
  <section class="pt-16 border-t border-neutral-200">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-baseline justify-between gap-12 font-mono text-xs">
      <a href="/vitals" class="group flex flex-col gap-2 transition-luxury">
        <span class="text-[9px] tracking-widest uppercase text-neutral-500 group-hover:text-amber-700">← PREVIOUS CASE STUDY</span>
        <span class="action-potential-link font-serif text-2xl font-light text-neutral-950 group-hover:text-amber-700 pb-1 w-fit">Vitals: Digital Medical ID</span>
        <span class="font-sans text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light">Overcoming the 92% drop-off barrier through trust-first onboarding</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/omara" class="group flex flex-col gap-2 sm:text-right transition-luxury">
        <span class="text-[9px] tracking-widest uppercase text-neutral-500 group-hover:text-amber-700">NEXT CASE STUDY →</span>
        <span class="action-potential-link font-serif text-2xl font-light text-neutral-950 group-hover:text-amber-700 pb-1 w-fit sm:ml-auto">Omara: GovTech Systems</span>
        <span class="font-sans text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light">Offline welfare application review &amp; design-system verification</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
</BaseLayout>
